<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Consolidated Papers cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Consolidated Papers cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities downgraded Consolidated Papers Inc to hold from buy, market sources said.</p>
<p>-- The stock ended Wednesday at 53-5/8.</p>
